    "content": "See you in London on 17 June?\n \nI'll be at the Food & Drink Exporters Association (FDEA) 35x35 Summer Export Conference - one of the most exciting days in the UK food and drink export calendar!\n\n📍 Royal Geographical Society\n👥 ~400 industry leaders\n🎯 A shared ambition: driving British exports to £35 billion by 2035\n \nYou can find me in the Export Education Centre representing NielsenIQ with other Food & Drink Exporters Association (FDEA) Approved Partners!\n\nWhether you’re looking to:\n👉 chat about what you’re working on\n👉 exchange ideas and insights\n👉 or simply put a face to a name\n\n👋  Come and say hello — I’d love to connect!\n\nAttending too? Let’s get ahead of the crowd: 💬 Join the conversation via the FDEA Collaborative: collaborative.fdea.org.uk\n\n📩 Or drop me a message here — always happy to connect before the day.\n\n⬇️ Link to grab the last few tickets in the comments below ⬇️ \n\n#FoodAndDrink #Exports #Networking #UKBusiness #FDEA #35x35",
